STATUS          : NO per-frame gain term is fitted or applied. This merge assumes
                  constant photometry across the stack. The number above is the size
                  of that assumption, not a correction for it. Do NOT read gain from
                  EXIF to fix it: M24 measured two stacks drifting 6.84% and 8.93%
                  with CONSTANT EXIF, and coffee-bean moving only 16% of what its
                  EXIF change predicts (1.0443 measured vs 1.2800). Fit it.

